			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Expand parameter extraction utilities for IPC dispatch\n\nExtend the `Utilities::Params` module with typed helpers (`i64_at`, `u64_at_or`, `obj_str`, `obj_val`, etc.) to handle both positional arrays and JSON object payloads without inline boilerplate. Introduce `obj_*` variants specifically for named-key extraction used by UI service providers.\n\nApply these new utilities across the `CreateEffectForRequest` tree (Debug, LanguageFeatures, SCM, Secrets, StatusBar, Terminal, TreeView, UserInterface, Webview) to replace verbose `get().and_then().unwrap_or()` chains. This unifies parameter parsing logic, reduces code duplication, and ensures consistent default handling for handles, strings, numbers, and boolean flags across all IPC request handlers.",
			"SHA": "d2d7207e90d0c620bbd6c0bc10c20754f3fbb529"
